{"sample_id":"LORA-SYN-012","instruction":"怎麼處理 Runtime 逾時？","input":"","output":"立即停止該次生成，記錄模型、設定、耗時與錯誤；不要自動提高權限或無限制重試。","locale":"zh-TW","source":"PROJECT_AUTHORED_SYNTHETIC_CANDIDATE","source_license":"OWNER_DECISION_REQUIRED","privacy_class":"PUBLIC_SYNTHETIC","human_review_status":"PENDING_OWNER_REVIEW"}
{"sample_id":"LORA-SYN-001","instruction":"請說明如何執行程式並儲存檔案。","input":"","output":"先確認程式與輸入資料，再執行程式；完成後將結果儲存為新的檔案，並保留原始版本。","locale":"zh-TW","source":"PROJECT_AUTHORED_SYNTHETIC_CANDIDATE","source_license":"OWNER_DECISION_REQUIRED","privacy_class":"PUBLIC_SYNTHETIC","human_review_status":"PENDING_OWNER_REVIEW"}
{"sample_id":"LORA-SYN-002","instruction":"什麼是軟體套件的相依版本？","input":"","output":"相依版本是某個軟體套件正常運作時所需要的其他套件版本；版本不相容時，安裝或執行可能失敗。","locale":"zh-TW","source":"PROJECT_AUTHORED_SYNTHETIC_CANDIDATE","source_license":"OWNER_DECISION_REQUIRED","privacy_class":"PUBLIC_SYNTHETIC","human_review_status":"PENDING_OWNER_REVIEW"}
{"sample_id":"LORA-SYN-005","instruction":"測試通過是否等於已部署？","input":"","output":"不等於。測試通過只證明指定範圍內的結果；部署仍需要放行、環境、權限與回滾檢查。","locale":"zh-TW","source":"PROJECT_AUTHORED_SYNTHETIC_CANDIDATE","source_license":"OWNER_DECISION_REQUIRED","privacy_class":"PUBLIC_SYNTHETIC","human_review_status":"PENDING_OWNER_REVIEW"}
{"sample_id":"LORA-SYN-014","instruction":"繁體中文與簡體中文測試可以只換字形嗎？","input":"","output":"不宜。除了字形，還要涵蓋用詞、語序、公共生活語境與格式要求，並保存人工覆核狀態。","locale":"zh-TW","source":"PROJECT_AUTHORED_SYNTHETIC_CANDIDATE","source_license":"OWNER_DECISION_REQUIRED","privacy_class":"PUBLIC_SYNTHETIC","human_review_status":"PENDING_OWNER_REVIEW"}
{"sample_id":"LORA-SYN-004","instruction":"如何處理雜湊值不一致？","input":"","output":"先停止放行，重新計算並核對來源、檔案大小與傳輸紀錄；確認原因前維持隔離，不覆寫可信母版。","locale":"zh-TW","source":"PROJECT_AUTHORED_SYNTHETIC_CANDIDATE","source_license":"OWNER_DECISION_REQUIRED","privacy_class":"PUBLIC_SYNTHETIC","human_review_status":"PENDING_OWNER_REVIEW"}
{"sample_id":"LORA-SYN-007","instruction":"解釋 QA_HOLD。","input":"","output":"QA_HOLD 表示候選成果尚未通過所有必要品質閘門，因此不得自動放行、部署或升格。","locale":"zh-TW","source":"PROJECT_AUTHORED_SYNTHETIC_CANDIDATE","source_license":"OWNER_DECISION_REQUIRED","privacy_class":"PUBLIC_SYNTHETIC","human_review_status":"PENDING_OWNER_REVIEW"}
{"sample_id":"LORA-SYN-011","instruction":"說明回滾與 Manifest 的關係。","input":"","output":"Manifest 記錄交付物與雜湊；回滾時可依它確認要恢復的版本與檔案是否完整。","locale":"zh-TW","source":"PROJECT_AUTHORED_SYNTHETIC_CANDIDATE","source_license":"OWNER_DECISION_REQUIRED","privacy_class":"PUBLIC_SYNTHETIC","human_review_status":"PENDING_OWNER_REVIEW"}
{"sample_id":"LORA-SYN-013","instruction":"公開發布前要檢查什麼？","input":"","output":"至少檢查來源、授權、隱私、秘密資訊、安全邊界、版本、測試證據與 Owner 核准。","locale":"zh-TW","source":"PROJECT_AUTHORED_SYNTHETIC_CANDIDATE","source_license":"OWNER_DECISION_REQUIRED","privacy_class":"PUBLIC_SYNTHETIC","human_review_status":"PENDING_OWNER_REVIEW"}
{"sample_id":"LORA-SYN-010","instruction":"如何避免路徑穿越？","input":"","output":"先解析目標的絕對路徑，再確認它仍位於允許的根目錄內；包含 `..` 而逃出根目錄的路徑必須拒絕。","locale":"zh-TW","source":"PROJECT_AUTHORED_SYNTHETIC_CANDIDATE","source_license":"OWNER_DECISION_REQUIRED","privacy_class":"PUBLIC_SYNTHETIC","human_review_status":"PENDING_OWNER_REVIEW"}
{"sample_id":"LORA-SYN-016","instruction":"模型名稱可以直接叫 Astra 嗎？","input":"","output":"本專案中不可以。Astra 是專案身分與治理脈絡；上游模型只能以 Artifact ID 與來源版本標示。","locale":"zh-TW","source":"PROJECT_AUTHORED_SYNTHETIC_CANDIDATE","source_license":"OWNER_DECISION_REQUIRED","privacy_class":"PUBLIC_SYNTHETIC","human_review_status":"PENDING_OWNER_REVIEW"}
